{"id":"W77e6a07a1d55d8bd9a381f5d","zh":"高速铁路","en":"","name":"高速铁路","language":"zh","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中以高速列车运营为主要对象的铁路系统。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"作为轨道不平顺检测与谱分析的工程对象，相关用法以京沪、沪宁、沪杭线路为实例，考察高速铁路的轨道不平顺特征。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W77e6a07a1d55d8bd9a381f5d","text":"高速铁路","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S32e5408dfc2e4385fe19","source_id":"P124","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明: 京沪、沪杭、沪宁高速铁路普遍存在2.8 ~2.9,6.45 ~6.5,24 ~25 和32 ~33 m 不利波长范围的周期性轨道不平顺; 高速铁路高低不平顺对车体垂向加速度影响显著; 各高铁线水平和扭曲不平顺对车体垂、横向振动不利波长主要为2.0 ~3.5 m 窄带周期性波长。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Scfb266780472e7c97a74","source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"轨道不平顺谱的计算分析 1.1 数据来源及谱估计方法轨道不平顺样本数据来源于2010 年沪宁、沪杭高速铁路和2011 年京沪高速铁路的检测数据, 采样间距为0.25 m。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P124":{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.001","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"本研究检测对象为京沪、沪宁、沪杭三条高速铁路。","language":"zh","source_id":"P124","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an","title":"高速铁路（京沪、沪宁、沪杭线）轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W1635744d3765fa39353d2185","name":"high -speed railway","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wcd06fb8a2e993a0581ed7ca2","name":"high-speed railway","language":"en","kind":"trans